<title>USA: Genovese Drug sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Genovese Drug sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genovese Drug Stores Inc said its board has declared a ten percent stock dividend, payable January 14, record December 26.</p>
<p>The company said it has also declared a $0.06 per share cash dividend, payable January 14, record December 27. The cash dividend is unchanged from last quarter.</p>
</text>
